Z||000000||Black88GT||09-09-2001||10:13 PM||||So, now that week 1 is wrapping up, what does everyone think about the replacement refs?<P>Personally, I can now say I TOLD YOU SO to everyone I talked to who said they are "endangering the players health" and blah blah blah.  I knew there wasn't going to be any major problems.  Hell, the regular refs aren't that good to begin with, and these guys are no change from that.  <P>I say let the whiney, greedy NFL refs go to hell and use the replacements all year if need be.  Maybe we could make the replacements the regulars.<P>||||reg||14
