Z||000003||Black88GT||09-10-2001||12:13 AM||||Just to clarify why I am against the NFL regulars, well they want a <B>400%</B> pay increase!  So of course the NFL rejected that and offered a 60% increase over the next 3 years or something along those lines.  The Refs union rejected it last week.  So the NFL was preparing to use the replacements, when on Saturday the refs union tried to save face and say basically that they will come back with no deal and it will go to an arbitrator.  Obviously the NFL wasn't go to accept it since they just prepped all these replacements.  So now the NFL pulled the offer of 60% and they are back down to 40%.<P><BR>Anywho, I hope the Panthers didn't piss off the Vikes!!  We have to play them monday night.||||reg||1
